**How to implement.** The last mentions of the optional complexity go, so `git grep -n -E "complexity = (None|Some)" -- Berreman/` finds nothing; from S1.3's first step its invariant `s03-complexity-mandatory` runs that grep after every step. No code changes. (1) `OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/MaterialsWindowTests.fs:459` and `:480`: the comments say Silicon is view-only because its complexity is not editable term data. (2) `OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/NkDispersionChartTests.fs`: `siliconEntry`'s doc (`:27`) says Silicon's dispersion is the published silicon law. `spec 0040 006: the gyration builder draws all six components for a coded preset with no stored class` (`:194-200`) is renamed `spec 0040 006: the gyration builder draws all six components when every component is requested`, and its comment no longer names a coded preset; its assertions are unchanged. (3) `OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests/OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.fsproj:120-124`: the existing comment ends at 'Save round-trips through MaterialProxy'. No comment is added.

